# The warehouse

dbt over DuckDB, in `warehouse/`. Staging types the raw files and applies the quarantine rules; intermediate joins the aircraft, airports and weather and builds the rotation keys; marts are what every reader of the data reads. {{ v('warehouse.models') }} models, {{ v('warehouse.tests') }} tests, {{ v('warehouse.tests_failed') }} failed on the last build.

